rustdesk (1.5.3-0ubuntu1~obs1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (Resolute Raccoon, amd64) OBS build for RustDesk 1.5.3.
  * Enable native Wayland support (PipeWire, XDG portals, DRM/KMS via libdrmtap,
    display wake via drm-wake, Wayland shortcuts inhibit).
  * Enable hardware-accelerated video codecs against system FFmpeg 8 (libva/vdpau/nvenc).

